            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>The supplied MX 24V 4.0Ah battery and charger is fully compatible with the LawnMaster MX 24V cordless range, including lawnmowers, hedge trimmers, grass trimmers, chainsaws and leaf blowers.</p>",
