            "pretitle": "",
            "title_tag": "h1",
            "title": "Free USB Power Bank Adapter",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Adapter to convert LawnMaster 24V and MX 24V batteries to a handy USB power bank. Perfect for charging USB devices while camping or doing DIY. Can charge up to 2 devices simultaneously with a total output current of 2.1A.</p>",
